# Accepted findings for the MIGRATE image only (images.yml scans it with
# --ignorefile .trivyignore.migrate). The runtime image is scanned with no
# exceptions: it does not contain these packages at all.
#
# All four come with the Prisma 7.8.0 CLI (prisma -> mysql2, @prisma/config ->
# deepmerge-ts + c12 -> source-map-js, @prisma/dev -> fast-uri). The migrate
# container runs only `prisma migrate deploy` against PostgreSQL, for a minute,
# on an internal network, then exits:
#   - mysql2: credential leak when connecting to a malicious MySQL server;
#     we never connect to MySQL.
#   - deepmerge-ts / source-map-js: denial of service on crafted input; the
#     only input is our own prisma.config.ts.
#   - fast-uri: URL parsing flaws in Prisma's local dev server (prisma dev),
#     which migrate deploy never starts.
# Fix: upgrade Prisma to 7.10.x (mysql2 3.24.4, deepmerge-ts 8.0.2) as its own
# tested change, then delete this file. The expiry forces that.
